flowchart LR
  Operator[Authenticated operator] --> Control[Operations control Durable Object]
  Control --> State[(Pause, source, and quota state)]
  Request[Internet request] --> Rate[Cloudflare Rate Limiting binding]
  Rate --> Worker[Worker route policy]
  State --> Worker
  Env[Immutable build bindings] --> Worker
  Worker --> API[API and WebSocket]
  Worker --> Map[Map assets]
  Worker --> Provider[Fixed provider capability]
  Audit[Control audit events] --> State
  Runbooks[Emergency and rollback procedures] --> Operator
